  npcName: Spouse
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 10913, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - Don't keep bringing it up.
  - Please, its getting old.
  - ARE YOU MOCKING ME!
  - I am so happy that you think of me, so thoughtful.
  - You really try to complete me.
  - YOU CANT EVEN LOOK ME IN MY EYES!
  - you do nothing but bring up things i cant do.
  - I feel more useless everyday.
  - Do you know how humiliating it is to learn to wipe again.
  - And every time you ignore me, it gets worse.
  - More and more useless, like a child.
  - But what is this?
  - ...
  - Is this a.. hand...
  - A real hand?
  - dripping with blood, but still cold and heavy?
  - Is it mine?! WOW, amazing!
  - How did you get the infection out?
  - How did you get it back from the doctor.
  - You really went the extra mile here.
  - 'I love you, and i will never leave you. '
  - This would have been so good, a few seconds after the accident.
  - But the thought is nice.
  - Thank you.
